OL,3,GNEWSAHope that abandoned deaf dog
OL,4,Alearns sign language
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff looking for a new home for an
OL,7,Fabandoned deaf dog said they hoped he
OL,8,Fwould be able to learn some sign
OL,9,Flanguage to help him navigate life.
OL,11,FEddie, a six-year-old bull breed, was
OL,12,Frescued by RSPCA officers and police
OL,13,Fwhen he was left by his owners at a
OL,14,Fproperty in Durham.
OL,16,FHe was taken to the charity's Block Fen
OL,17,Fcentre at Wimblington in
OL,18,FCambridgeshire, where staff discovered
OL,19,Fhe was deaf.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
