OL,3,GNEWSAHope that abandoned deaf dog
OL,4,Alearns sign language
OL,5,
OL,6,FKennel supervisor Tiffany Fowler said:
OL,7,F"He'll sit if you hold a treat up above
OL,8,Fhis head, so we think he'll pick up
OL,9,Fsign language well and enjoy training.
OL,10,FWe all chat away to him, and if he's
OL,11,Flooking at us, he'll wag his tail and
OL,12,Fget excited - it's like he can lip-read
OL,13,Fand knows we're speaking to him."
